-15#:~:text=Can%20you%20know%20yourself%3F,it%20something%20entirely%20different%3F","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Nature of Identity\" by Wizards of the Coast. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 15 Jan 2014."}},{"id":"nature-identity-2014-01-15-e3","era":null,"summary":"Samia asks about the Returned and eidolons, and Perisophia explains that they lack the capacity for an identity.","participants":["perisophia","samia","returned","eidolon","dekatia"],"location":"meletis","importance":"major","page":"stories/nature-identity-2014-01-15","order":400,"story_date":"2014-01-15","storyline":"Theros","source":"wizards","paragraph":33,"quote":"It would appear that the Returned and the eidolons lack the capacity for an identity.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/nature-identity-2014-01-15#:~:text=It%20would%20appear%20that,capacity%20for%20an%20identity.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Nature of Identity","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Wizards of the Coast"],"date":"2014-01-15","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/nature-identity-2014-01-15","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/nature-identity-2014-01-15#:~:text=It%20would%20appear%20that,capacity%20for%20an%20identity.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Nature of Identity\" by Wizards of the Coast. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 15 Jan 2014."}},{"id":"nature-identity-2014-01-15-e4","era":null,"summary":"Salis raises the story of Matatios, and Perisophia warns that Matatios only met himself and did not become aware of himself.","participants":["perisophia","salis","matatios"],"location":"meletis","importance":"minor","page":"stories/nature-identity-2014-01-15","order":400,"story_date":"2014-01-15","storyline":"Theros","source":"wizards","paragraph":35,"quote":"Matatios did not become aware of himself, he only met himself.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/nature-identity-2014-01-15#:~:text=Matatios%20did%20not%20become,he%20only%20met%20himself.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Nature of Identity","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Wizards of the Coast"],"date":"2014-01-15","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/nature-identity-2014-01-15","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/nature-identity-2014-01-15#:~:text=Matatios%20did%20not%20become,he%20only%20met%20himself.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Nature of Identity\" by Wizards of the Coast. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 15 Jan 2014."}},{"id":"nature-identity-2014-01-15-e5","era":null,"summary":"Perisophia ends the lesson by saying that identity lives in the moment and that each person is the architect of it.","participants":["perisophia","rhytho"],"location":"meletis","importance":"major","page":"stories/nature-identity-2014-01-15","order":400,"story_date":"2014-01-15","storyline":"Theros","source":"wizards","paragraph":38,"quote":"Identity is not in the past, nor does it dwell in the future. It lives in the moment.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/nature-identity-2014-01-15#:~:text=Identity%20is%20not%20in,lives%20in%20the%20moment.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Nature of Identity","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Wizards of the Coast"],"date":"2014-01-15","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/nature-identity-2014-01-15","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/nature-identity-2014-01-15#:~:text=Identity%20is%20not%20in,lives%20in%20the%20moment.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Nature of Identity\" by Wizards of the Coast. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 15 Jan 2014."}},{"id":"nature-identity-2014-01-15-e6","era":null,"summary":"In a dream-vision in a void of stars, Ephara asks Perisophia about Meletis and warns that war is coming and a tyrant tears at the threshold of the world.","participants":["ephara","perisophia"],"location":null,"importance":"major","page":"stories/nature-identity-2014-01-15","order":400,"story_date":"2014-01-15","storyline":"Theros","source":"wizards","paragraph":42,"quote":"War is coming. A tyrant tears at the threshold of our world and yours","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/nature-identity-2014-01-15#:~:text=War%20is%20coming.%20A,our%20world%20and%20yours","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Nature of Identity","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Wizards of the Coast"],"date":"2014-01-15","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/nature-identity-2014-01-15","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/nature-identity-2014-01-15#:~:text=War%20is%20coming.%20A,our%20world%20and%20yours","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Nature of Identity\" by Wizards of the Coast. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 15 Jan 2014."}},{"id":"nature-identity-2014-01-15-e7","era":null,"summary":"Perisophia vows to speak only words that uplift the human mind and soul with her dying breath.","participants":["perisophia","ephara"],"location":null,"importance":"major","page":"stories/nature-identity-2014-01-15","order":400,"story_date":"2014-01-15","storyline":"Theros","source":"wizards","paragraph":44,"quote":"With my dying breath I will speak only words that uplift the human mind and soul.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/nature-identity-2014-01-15#:~:text=With%20my%20dying%20breath,human%20mind%20and%20soul.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Nature of Identity","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Wizards of the Coast"],"date":"2014-01-15","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/nature-identity-2014-01-15","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/nature-identity-2014-01-15#:~:text=With%20my%20dying%20breath,human%20mind%20and%20soul.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Nature of Identity\" by Wizards of the Coast. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 15 Jan 2014."}},{"id":"dance-flitterstep-2014-02-19-e1","era":null,"summary":"The phalanx leader reports to Perisophia and the council that the Weeping Woman is no longer alone and leads three masked children.","participants":["phalanx-leader","perisophia","weeping-woman","missing-children"],"location":"dekatia","importance":"major","page":"stories/dance-flitterstep-2014-02-19","order":405,"story_date":"2014-02-19","storyline":"Theros","source":"wizards","paragraph":22,"quote":"We have again seen the Weeping Woman. And... she is no longer alone.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/dance-flitterstep-2014-02-19#:~:text=We%20have%20again%20seen,is%20no%20longer%20alone.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Dance of the Flitterstep","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Jennifer Clarke Wilkes"],"date":"2014-02-19","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/dance-flitterstep-2014-02-19","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/dance-flitterstep-2014-02-19#:~:text=We%20have%20again%20seen,is%20no%20longer%20alone.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Dance of the Flitterstep\" by Jennifer Clarke Wilkes. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 19 Feb 2014."}},{"id":"dance-flitterstep-2014-02-19-e2","era":null,"summary":"The captain admits he could not strike down the children, and Perisophia comforts him, saying tenderness stayed his hand.","participants":["phalanx-leader","perisophia"],"location":"dekatia","importance":"minor","page":"stories/dance-flitterstep-2014-02-19","order":405,"story_date":"2014-02-19","storyline":"Theros","source":"wizards","paragraph":30,"quote":"Tenderness, not weakness, stayed your hand.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/dance-flitterstep-2014